# Shopping in Russian: можно примерить?
subtitle: "In a Russian clothes shop: say it's too dear or cheap, ask to try it on and for a size up, hear whether it suits you, and decide with я бы взял."
tags: ["russian","shopping in russian","clothes","можно примерить","russian phrases"]
teaches: ["phrases/shopping"]
thumb: "band \"Does it suit me? Ask in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"At the doctor in Russian: что у вас боли́т?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/76-russian-doctor.cast"}

## Shopping in Russian: можно примерить?
